  "prefLabel": "Liq 206.03 Fines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 206.03 Fines. All administrative fines imposed by the presiding officer shall be paid within 5 business days of receipt of the commission order.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
